<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-bg border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

    <span
      class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans block mb-8"
      data-animate
    >/ How It Works</span>

    <h2
      class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-heading leading-tight mb-8"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.1"
    >
      Most agencies optimize for clicks.<br/>EngageEngine™ finds the buyers behind them.
    </h2>

    <div class="mechanism-lines" data-animate data-delay="0.2">
      <p>
        Every day, homeowners in your market are actively comparing contractors — searching reviews, checking prices, deciding who to call. Most of them haven't contacted anyone yet.
      </p>
      <p>
        EngageEngine™ identifies those buyers by name and address while they're still in the decision window. We route your spend toward the people most likely to book — before your competitors know they exist.
      </p>
      <p>
        The result: you stop paying to reach everyone and start reaching the people already looking for what you do.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mechanism-lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(200, 168, 75, 0.3);
  }
  .mechanism-lines p {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #8ba3bf;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
